      "start_seconds": 46.03,
      "end_seconds": 61.83,
      "duration_seconds": 15.8,
      "text": "okay: BP is 151 over 92 weight 66 kilos and BMI works out to 25.1 height 162 centimetres respiratory rate 17 SpO2 97 percent on room air pulse is 86 beats a minute"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
